  "distractor_rules": {
    "roots": [
      "Always offer four unique choices and exactly one right answer.",
      "The stem must show the expanded pronoun plus verb, such as I am, she is, they have, or I will. Choices show contracted forms.",
      "Never make an n't form the target. Those are not pronoun-verb contractions.",
      "Tier 1 distractors use a different pronoun, such as I'm versus he's or we're.",
      "Tier 2 distractors keep the same pronoun but change the verb, or use your versus you're and its versus it's.",
      "Tier 3 distractors are near misses: they're versus their versus there, and I'll versus I've versus I'd.",
      "Keep every stem in kid world: school, home, food, pets, play, family, or weather. No brands and no real names.",
      "Do not reuse the same four-choice set on back-to-back items. Mix answer_index."
    ]
  },
